    "title": "JSON schema for Esquio configuration files",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "description": "Subject: Current Esquio Feature\u2011Toggle Configuration  \n\nThe Esquio configuration defines two products\u2014**WebApp** and **MobileApp**.\u202fFor **WebApp**, the feature **NewHomepage** is enabled, while the feature **BetaFeature** is disabled.\u202fThe **MobileApp** product includes a single enabled feature called **PushNotifications**.\n\nFeature **NewHomepage** is controlled by two toggles: a **Percentage** toggle set to\u202f50\u202fpercent, and a **UserId** toggle that permits the identifiers\u202fuser123\u202fand\u202fuser456.\u202fFeature **BetaFeature** uses a **DateRange** toggle that is active from\u202f2024\u201101\u201101\u202fthrough\u202f2024\u201102\u201101.\u202fFeature **PushNotifications** is limited to the **staging** environment via an **Environment** toggle.",
  "reference_json": {
    "Esquio": {
      "Products": [
        {
          "Name": "WebApp",
          "Features": [
            {
              "Name": "NewHomepage",
              "Enabled": true,
              "Toggles": [
                {
                  "Type": "Percentage",
                  "Parameters": {
                    "percentage": 50
                  }
                },
                {
                  "Type": "UserId",
                  "Parameters": {
                    "allowedIds": [
                      "user123",
                      "user456"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "Name": "BetaFeature",
              "Enabled": false,
              "Toggles": [
                {
                  "Type": "DateRange",
                  "Parameters": {
                    "start": "2024-01-01",
                    "end": "2024-02-01"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "Name": "MobileApp",
          "Features": [
            {
              "Name": "PushNotifications",
              "Enabled": true,
              "Toggles": [
                {
                  "Type": "Environment",
                  "Parameters": {
                    "env": "staging"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}